savvy-progress, in claude-kit by johnnyvizz: https://github.com/JohnnyVizz/claude-kit/tree/main/plugins/savvy-progress

Ideas taken: the progress band with a phase pill and percent, the agents panel with summary cards and Running and Finished groups, a
progress bar per row, one animated pixel character per row, and respect for reduced motion.

Code: a few helper lines and the stepping animation rules in hooks/draw.ts and some lines of hooks/register.tsx are the same as lines of
that plugin. The character art is original.

